# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true, the default this
# whole course has been built under) converts these to CRLF line
# endings — which breaks their #!/bin/sh shebang inside the Linux
# container with a "bad interpreter" error that has nothing to do with
# anything actually wrong in the script itself. Force LF regardless of
# the checking-out machine's OS or git config.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
